sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant CLI as primordial CLI
    participant GH as GitHub Resolver
    participant Vault as Key Vault
    participant WT as Worktree Manager
    participant E2B as E2B Sandbox
    participant Proxy as API Key Proxy
    participant Agent as Agent Process

    User->>CLI: primordial run github.com/owner/agent
    CLI->>GH: Resolve & clone repo
    GH-->>CLI: agent.yaml + source code

    CLI->>CLI: Validate manifest<br/>(name, version, permissions, keys)
    CLI->>User: Show permissions prompt
    User-->>CLI: Approve

    CLI->>Vault: Decrypt required API keys
    Vault-->>CLI: Real API keys

    opt If workspace access requested
        CLI->>WT: Create git worktree<br/>branch: primordial/agent--session
        WT-->>CLI: Worktree path
        CLI->>CLI: Snapshot workspace → tar.gz
    end

    CLI->>E2B: Create Firecracker microVM
    Note over E2B: VM Hardening:<br/>remove sudo/su<br/>mount /proc hidepid=2<br/>network lockdown

    CLI->>Proxy: Start proxy (as root)<br/>Inject real API keys via stdin
    Note over Proxy: Binds localhost:9001-900N<br/>Generates session tokens

    CLI->>E2B: Upload workspace snapshot
    CLI->>Agent: Start agent process (as user)<br/>env: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sess-xxx<br/>env: ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:9001

    Agent-->>CLI: {"type": "ready"}

    loop Conversation
        User->>CLI: User message
        CLI->>Agent: {"type":"message", "content":"...", "message_id":"msg_001"}
        Agent->>Proxy: HTTP request with sess-xxx token
        Proxy->>Proxy: Swap fake token → real key
        Proxy-->>Agent: API response (filtered headers)
        Agent-->>CLI: {"type":"activity", "tool":"web_search", ...}
        Agent-->>CLI: {"type":"response", "content":"...", "done":true}
        CLI-->>User: Agent response
    end

    User->>CLI: Exit / shutdown
    CLI->>Agent: {"type": "shutdown"}
    Agent-->>CLI: Exit

    opt If workspace was readwrite
        CLI->>E2B: Capture git diff
        E2B-->>CLI: Workspace patch
        CLI->>WT: Apply patch to worktree
        CLI-->>User: Review commands:<br/>git diff main..branch<br/>git merge branch
    end

    CLI->>E2B: Destroy sandbox
